k_uuid":"21ca4d70-8fb0-4fc6-b447-fb31902edc58","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"1de6-46da-a661-401c"},{"link_uuid":"a97c30a8-d89e-46c5-bb56-5108b9d43e44","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"91ed-90d4-c69a-44c9"},{"link_uuid":"05ad386a-2ddf-400a-a008-517b143a139d","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"9342-86c3-6812-4d4f"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe tests/e2e cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/e2e/_toolchain.py:1-33, 52-55, 77-80, 140-152, 155-160` — Preserve collection-time provisioning, bounds, lock ordering, optional-browser distinction, and named failures. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/e2e/conftest.py:1-16, 44-47, 56-66, 133-138` — Preserve selection-triggered provisioning and failure re-reporting. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/e2e/test_editor_batch_library.py:1-20` — Preserve real-browser boundary, temporary project root, and four observable guarantees. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/e2e/test_editor_browser.py:1-11, 63-69, 98-101` — Preserve why a real browser is required and each observable behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/e2e/test_editor_e2e.py:1-9, 105-110` — Preserve the real `bpmn-moddle` fidelity boundary. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/e2e/test_editor_library.py:1-11` — Preserve browser boundary and library/create persistence contract. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/e2e/test_toolchain_provisioning.py:1-14, 241-250, 295-302, 387-396, 541-546, 576-581, 610-616` — Preserve deterministic interleaving, lock-order oracle, collection hook, re-report-once behavior, and readiness semantics. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest --collect-only tests/e2e/_toolchain.py tests/e2e/conftest.py tests/e2e/test_editor_batch_library.py tests/e2e/test_editor_browser.py tests/e2e/test_editor_e2e.py tests/e2e/test_editor_library.py tests/e2e/test_toolchain_provisioning.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/e2e/_toolchain.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/e2e/conftest.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/e2e/test_editor_batch_library.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/e2e/test_editor_browser.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/e2e/test_editor_e2e.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/e2e/test_editor_library.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/e2e/test_toolchain_provisioning.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","2d43-3c39-307e-4450"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"2d43-3c39-307e-4450","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_id":"0e3c-e47c-2cdf-4c6f","ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in tests/e2e","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["dc6f49ee-3ce4-4469-b26f-4888696843a4","eab6743e-f814-456c-b6d7-6cc47db774fd","f2daf016-11f9-49ce-a720-c4aa2c483256","e25b50f1-85c5-41a6-a74b-7719349be1c7","43d7d11a-10f9-42bc-bf68-07333ffd99e9","9f2a3c7d-2ddd-4524-baf1-d3ad928e18d9","21ca4d70-8fb0-4fc6-b447-fb31902edc58","a97c30a8-d89e-46c5-bb56-5108b9d43e44","05ad386a-2ddf-400a-a008-517b143a139d"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788582496569483001,"uuid":"304c887c-370e-4852-982b-62ede1ffa033"}